The four-concept frame lives in `docs/architecture/` (README first). Code in `heavymap/` is stdlib Python with tests in `tests/` (`python3 -m unittest discover -s tests`). Fixtures are synthetic (`SYN-` ids) and identifier-only: no owner fields, no raw row dumps. ADRs go in `docs/architecture/adr/`.
